{"sections":[{"slug":"Galois群","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Galois群"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Galois 群"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于域扩张</span> $K\\hookrightarrow L$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义其</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $\\operatorname{Gal}(L/K)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $L$ <span lang=\"zh\">的保持</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">中元素不动的自同构的群</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> pro-<span lang=\"zh\">有限群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">每个</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群都是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/pro-有限群","text":"pro-<span lang=\"zh\">有限群</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">它是所有有限中间扩张的</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群的极限</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">绝对</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">域</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可分闭包","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群称为</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的绝对</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与</span> Frobenius <span lang=\"zh\">态射的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有限域的有限扩张的</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $\\operatorname{Gal}(\\mathbb F_{p^n}/\\mathbb F_p)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Frobenius态射","text":"Frobenius <span lang=\"zh\">态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">生成的循环群</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}